      "sourceTextSha256": "6c7f3cea515ebb666a0dad50cc460d60417f6d55b8b7d120f2e48c4feac65f91",
      "text": "Arrival in Caracas. Meet your guide and transfer to Choroní. Check-in at a posada hotel. Dinner and rest.\n\nPueblo Choroní, a coastal fishing town, is more than just beaches and the sea — it also offers tropical mountain landscapes and the scenery of Henri Pittier National Park, which boasts the largest bird diversity in Latin America. Here, you can take walks to beaches, waterfalls, lagoons, and the historic center of Choroní.\n\nMeals: dinner",
